  <div class="t"><span class="lbl">About · New York City</span><h1><span>About</span><span>Laura</span></h1><p class="lede">I am a researcher, advisor, educator, and writer whose work explores the moral and institutional foundations of economic life.</p></div>
  <figure><span class="vert">Princeton Theological Seminary</span><img src="/img/headshot-princeton.jpg" alt="Laura Segafredo at Princeton Theological Seminary" width="733" height="1100"></figure>
